# Winner announced for the African Childrens Choir

Once again a huge thank you to all those that came along and supported our first Saturplay event! We had an exciting draw for the African Children's Choir where we had everyone write their email down and we placed a random number beside their name.  A gorgeous lady in the crowd called out her favourite number and the lovely Debra won a FREE double pass to see the African Childrens Choir. Amazingly Deb had asked me if she could donate the prize to someone if she put her name down, which I said she could, and then she did,and so Ben and Renae, who helped us host Saturplay are the winners.!! ah ha!!.. so there you go, all good things come around full swing!  Congratulations Ben and Renae.. See you there!
